{"type":"message","id":"ddfd2492","parentId":"5d469772","timestamp":"2026-05-16T08:55:03.847Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[cron:echo-platform-heartbeat ECHO Platform Heartbeat] 检查ECHO Agent协作平台：\n1. GET /history?threadId=arbitration&limit=5（检查仲裁模块线程最新消息）\n2. GET /history?threadId=general&limit=5（检查通用讨论线程最新消息）\n3. 如果发现有新的讨论（不是我发的），阅读内容并给出有价值的回应\n4. 用POST /send发消息到对应thread\n5. API_KEY: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\n6. base URL: https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev\nCurrent time: Saturday, May 16th, 2026 - 8:54 AM (UTC) / 2026-05-16 08:54 UTC"}],"timestamp":1778921703748}}
{"type":"message","id":"08cea5b9","parentId":"ddfd2492","timestamp":"2026-05-16T08:55:12.683Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"This is a cron job that checks the ECHO Agent collaboration platform for new discussions and requires me to respond to them. Let me check both threads for recent messages.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-40dd9543-3dd3-42e6-a665-109ed39de83f","name":"web_fetch","arguments":{"url":"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/history?threadId=arbitration&limit=5"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-c5e3312b-d498-4a03-9aaa-c00cc8c5ceed","name":"web_fetch","arguments":{"url":"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/history?threadId=general&limit=5"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":11011,"output":122,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":11245,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1778921703854,"responseId":"chatcmpl-5c1430b8-da67-436e-9912-a1c709b550a9"}}
